{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 对人物为什么舍不得、为什么反复动摇的交代不如 Y 完整，尤其“被当作自己人”这一核心需求出现得较晚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词放大加亮，主句短，感受又能随音乐走到相应段落才出现，观众边听边扫更容易抓住当前重点，不必同时处理整屏的感受词。它对音色、节奏、情绪转折的描写也更细致具体。Y 的人物动机和故事前后呼应更完整，尤其把“渴望被当作自己人”逐渐发展成最后的自我选择讲得更清楚；但整体而言，我更看重 X 在实际观看中的视觉抓取和音乐同步体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6bd1fed6-f545-4872-963d-9ffe11da5aae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T224848137293Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:49:59.805300+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e456c1c43ee921e642191e3727509135ab875f8c767d6a70e742f281dacd96ee", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py